       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ACOUSTIC-LEVITATOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ACOUSTIC-LEVITATOR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GORKOV-TRAPPING-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FEYNMAN-SUPERPOS-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STATE-RESOLUTION-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LEVITATOR-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ACOUSTIC-LEV-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ACOUSTIC-LEV-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-LEV-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-LEV-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GORKOV-AND-SUPERPOS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RESOLVE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-LEV-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GORKOV-AND-SUPERPOS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GORKOV-TRAPPING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FEYNMAN-SUPERPOS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RESOLVE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STATE-RESOLUTION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LEVITATOR-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-LEV-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GORKOV-TRAPPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FEYNMAN-SUPERPOS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STATE-RESOLUTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LEVITATOR-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ACOUSTIC-LEV-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-LEV-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-LEV-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-LEV-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-LEV-CODE.
